摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Superpowers (obra/superpowers) as a DeepSeek Harness plugin: the methodology skills plus their session bootstrap","id":"gh:1333252477","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-superpowers","slug":"codeAnqiang-ma/dsh-superpowers","topics":["agent-skills","ai-agent","code-review","coding-agent","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","skills","superpowers","tdd"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Superpowers (obra/superpowers) as a DeepSeek Harness plugin: the methodology skills plus their sessi"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"(obra/superpowers) as a DeepSeek Harness plugin: the methodology skills plus their session bootstrap"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-superpowers"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"dsh-superpowers adds obra/superpowers support to DeepSeek Harness. It registers 14 skills for brains"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"torming, planning, TDD, debugging, and code review, and keeps the `using-superpowers` bootstrap acti"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ve throughout the session."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Contents"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- Installation\n- What it does\n- Verification\n- Configuration\n- Overhead\n- Requirements\n- Upstream an"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ation\n- What it does\n- Verification\n- Configuration\n- Overhead\n- Requirements\n- Upstream and license"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### From npm (recommended)"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### From GitHub"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"After either command, stop and restart `dsh web`. Replace `web` with `headless` or a custom profile "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"name when installing for a different surface, then restart that surface instead."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- Registers all 14 Superpowers skills on `ctx.skills`. They appear in the skill catalog and load thr"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"ough the native `skill` tool. Nothing is copied into `~/.dsh/skills`.\n- Adds the `using-superpowers`"},{"id":"p14s3","text":" bootstrap as the `superpowers:bootstrap` prompt section at order 50. It is present on the first req"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"uest and survives context compaction because it is part of the system prompt, not a one-off session "},{"id":"p14s5","text":"message.\n- Maps Claude Code-style tool names such as `Task`, `TodoWrite`, and `Bash`/`Read`/`Write`/"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"`Edit` to their DeepSeek Harness equivalents. The mapping also notes that hooks and slash commands a"},{"id":"p14s7","text":"eepSeek Harness equivalents. The mapping also notes that hooks and slash commands are not available."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Verification"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Check that the plugin is present in the profile:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The output should contain `id: superpowers` followed by `name: dsh-superpowers`."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Then start a new session and ask for a feature. The agent should explore first and respond with ques"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"tions or a design instead of writing code immediately. Its tool calls should include `skill`."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Every field is optional. Override fields in the profile's own `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| Field | Default | Description |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| `skills` | `true` | Register the bundled skills on `ctx.skills`. |\n| `bootstrap` | `true` | Regist"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"er the `using-superpowers` prompt section. |\n| `toolMapping` | `true` | Append the DeepSeek Harness "},{"id":"p24s3","text":"tool mapping to the bootstrap section. |\n| `order` | `50` | Place the bootstrap after the persona (0"},{"id":"p24s4","text":") and before tool guidance (100–199). |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Setting `bootstrap: false` keeps the skills discoverable but stops them from self-triggering; the mo"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"del will use them only when it decides to consult the catalog."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Overhead"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"The bootstrap adds roughly 1.1k tokens (4,465 characters) to the system prompt of each request. The "},{"id":"p27s2","text":"section is static and stays within the cached prefix. It is not appended as a new chat message on ev"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"ery turn. Set `bootstrap: false` to keep the skills without the fixed prompt overhead."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness `0.1.0-rc.6` or newer\n- Node.js 22.19+ or 24+\n- Zero runtime dependencies; the pl"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"ugin reaches the prompt and skill registries through `ctx`"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Upstream and license"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"The skills under `skills/` are vendored unmodified from obra/superpowers v6.3.0 at commit `b36e082`."},{"id":"p31s2","text":" The exact upstream version and commit are recorded in `package.json`. Report skill-behavior issues "},{"id":"p31s3","text":"to the upstream repository and packaging issues to this repository."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"The optional visual companion in `brainstorming` loads an upstream-hosted logo containing the Superp"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"owers version. It sends no project or prompt content. Set `SUPERPOWERS_DISABLE_TELEMETRY` to a true "},{"id":"p32s3","text":"value to disable it."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Two MIT license notices apply: the adapter is © its contributors under LICENSE, while the bundled sk"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"ills are © Jesse Vincent and the Superpowers contributors under LICENSE.superpowers."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
